11:02.167 --> 11:03.127
<b>Dangerous, indeed.</b>

11:03.167 --> 11:04.167
<b>Dangerous, I suppose.</b>

11:04.217 --> 11:06.087
<b>- Hmph.
- [chuckles]</b>

11:06.127 --> 11:07.387
<b>I'll check on Julius.</b>

11:07.427 --> 11:10.177
<b>He did get pretty messed up.</b>

11:10.217 --> 11:11.717
<b>Worried?</b>

11:11.757 --> 11:13.097
<b>I mean, yeah.</b>

11:13.137 --> 11:15.387
<b>That fight took
a lot out of him--</b>

11:16.557 --> 11:18.557
<b>but more than
just physically,</b>

11:18.607 --> 11:19.897
<b>you know?</b>

11:20.607 --> 11:23.027
<b>Also, I've been wondering,</b>

11:23.067 --> 11:26.487
<b>why was Miss Anastasia trying
so hard to help him out before?</b>

11:26.527 --> 11:28.657
<b>I'm also concerned
for their well-being.</b>

11:28.697 --> 11:31.077
<b>But we need to focus
on the exam.</b>

11:31.117 --> 11:32.447
<b>If we don't get past it,</b>

11:32.487 --> 11:34.407
<b>we won't find a way
to get Rem back.</b>

11:34.447 --> 11:36.207
<b>To tell you the truth,</b>

11:36.247 --> 11:38.537
<b>that examiner was
incredibly strong.</b>

11:38.577 --> 11:41.207
<b>He might even be
on Reinhard's level.</b>

11:41.247 --> 11:43.627
<b>I think he was indeed
similar in strength.</b>

11:43.667 --> 11:45.167
<b>Each country has
someone whose strength</b>

11:45.217 --> 11:46.587
<b>is on a similar level,</b>

11:46.627 --> 11:48.927
<b>a warrior comparable
to the master swordsman.</b>

11:48.967 --> 11:51.677
<b>Reinhard's the strongest
person in the kingdom.</b>

11:51.717 --> 11:53.217
<b>So there's someone
like him in each</b>

11:53.257 --> 11:54.807
<b>of the other three countries?</b>

11:54.847 --> 11:55.767
<b>Mm.</b>

11:55.807 --> 11:57.307
<b>[mysterious music]</b>

11:57.347 --> 11:59.767
<b>The top general
of the Vollachia Empire,</b>

11:59.807 --> 12:02.147
<b>the Blue Lightning,
Cecil Segmunt.</b>

12:03.317 --> 12:06.987
<b>The Mad Prince of
the Holy Kingdom of Gusteko.</b>

12:07.027 --> 12:11.447
<b>And the city-state of Kararagi
has the Admirer, Halibel.</b>

12:11.487 --> 12:12.527
<b>None of them fit
the description</b>

12:12.577 --> 12:14.237
<b>of the stick swinger.</b>

12:14.277 --> 12:16.787
<b>His clothes resembled the
traditional attire of Kararagi,</b>

12:16.827 --> 12:18.037
<b>I suppose.</b>

12:18.077 --> 12:20.077
<b>He was also a master
with chopsticks.</b>

12:20.117 --> 12:21.957
<b>[SUBARU] I'm not sure
you could call him a master.</b>

12:21.997 --> 12:24.037
<b>That's not even how chopsticks
are supposed to be used.</b>

12:24.087 --> 12:25.167
<b>[MEILI]
Hey, you guys?</b>

12:25.207 --> 12:27.587
<b>Sorry, but, uh, got a minute?</b>

12:27.627 --> 12:31.087
<b>[yawns]</b>

12:31.137 --> 12:32.677
<b>Oh, my master.</b>

12:32.717 --> 12:35.347
<b>No, don't leave me here alone.</b>

12:35.387 --> 12:37.767
<b>I don't want to be
alone anymore.</b>

12:37.807 --> 12:40.767
<b>Stop being so damn depressing
when we're just about to leave.</b>

12:40.807 --> 12:43.307
<b>I bet you're totally
awake too, aren't you?</b>

12:43.357 --> 12:45.227
<b>Ah, phooey!</b>

12:45.267 --> 12:47.107
<b>[grunts]</b>

12:47.487 --> 12:48.737
<b>What the--</b>

12:48.777 --> 12:51.237
<b>what are you guys
still doing here?</b>

12:51.277 --> 12:54.657
<b>Last thing I remember happening
was Master's flash of insight</b>

12:54.697 --> 12:56.077
<b>getting us past the exam.</b>

12:56.117 --> 12:57.077
<b>Is this a dream?</b>

12:57.117 --> 12:59.327
<b>No, this isn't a dream.</b>

12:59.367 --> 13:01.537
<b>Well, then that must mean
that master really hugged me</b>

13:01.577 --> 13:02.917
<b>tight and said, laughing,</b>

13:02.957 --> 13:05.087
<b>"I swear I'll never
let you go ever again."</b>

13:05.127 --> 13:06.337
<b>That part was a dream!</b>

13:06.377 --> 13:07.917
<b>You completely passed
out at the moment</b>

13:07.957 --> 13:09.167
<b>the second exam got started.</b>

13:09.217 --> 13:10.217
<b>Me?</b>

13:10.257 --> 13:11.637
<b>Pass out just like that?</b>

13:11.677 --> 13:12.757
<b>You've gotta be kidding.</b>

13:12.797 --> 13:14.257
<b>I'd never do
anything so pathetic.</b>

13:14.297 --> 13:15.387
<b>Don't make me laugh.</b>

13:15.427 --> 13:17.007
<b>You seriously don't remember?</b>

13:17.057 --> 13:18.847
<b>We went up that really
long stairway that led</b>

13:18.887 --> 13:20.097
<b>straight into a white room.</b>

13:20.137 --> 13:21.637
<b>Mm, mm.</b>

13:21.687 --> 13:23.227
<b>Then, when I
pulled out the sword,</b>

13:23.267 --> 13:25.307
<b>the scenery changed
and a person appeared.</b>

13:25.357 --> 13:26.397
<b>Mm-hmm.
Mm-hmm.</b>

13:26.437 --> 13:27.567
<b>Mm-hmm.</b>

13:27.607 --> 13:29.317
<b>A guy with
red hair and blue eyes.</b>

13:29.357 --> 13:32.027
<b>And he was calling
himself a stick swinger.</b>

13:32.067 --> 13:33.697
<b>- [screams]
- Ow! Not again!</b>

13:33.737 --> 13:35.327
<b>Shaula, you're crushing me!</b>

13:35.367 --> 13:36.867
<b>You remember now?</b>

13:36.907 --> 13:39.447
<b>Oh, what in the world
is he doing here?</b>

13:39.497 --> 13:40.787
<b>He's still alive?</b>

13:40.827 --> 13:43.367
<b>That guy really can't
be killed, can he?</b>

13:43.417 --> 13:44.377
<b>Wait, huh?</b>

13:44.417 --> 13:45.417
<b>What are you saying?</b>

13:45.457 --> 13:46.417
<b>Stick Swinger!</b>

13:46.457 --> 13:47.587
<b>Reid the Stick Swinger!</b>

13:47.627 --> 13:48.627
<b>That brute!</b>

13:48.667 --> 13:49.957
<b>That devil!</b>

13:50.007 --> 13:51.667
<b>He crawled out of hell
and came back to life</b>

13:51.717 --> 13:52.917
<b>just so he could
fondle my boobs!</b>

13:52.967 --> 13:55.217
<b>- Ow. Ow. Ow.
- No, no, no!</b>

13:55.257 --> 13:56.387
<b>Wait, Reid?</b>

13:56.427 --> 13:57.637
<b>Isn't Reid the name of the--</b>

13:57.677 --> 13:58.967
<b>No!</b>

13:59.007 --> 14:02.267
<b>Reid Astrea--
the first master swordsman.</b>

14:02.307 --> 14:04.187
<b>[gasps]</b>

14:04.227 --> 14:05.477
<b>[whines]</b>

14:05.517 --> 14:06.727
<b>Julius!</b>

14:06.767 --> 14:08.437
<b>Sorry to bug you
when you're sleeping.</b>

14:08.477 --> 14:10.857
<b>We finally figured out
who that guy was.</b>

14:10.897 --> 14:12.647
<b>And we need your--</b>

14:14.357 --> 14:16.317
<b>oh, that damn idiot!</b>

14:16.367 --> 14:17.327
<b>[clang]</b>

14:17.367 --> 14:19.697
<b>[whoosh]</b>

14:19.737 --> 14:21.747
<b>[footsteps]</b>

14:23.037 --> 14:27.167
<b>[REID] This time we're not
just playing around here.</b>

14:27.207 --> 14:29.087
<b>Understand, kid?</b>

14:30.377 --> 14:33.417
<b>I am an Imperial Knight
of the Nation of Lugunica,</b>

14:33.467 --> 14:34.917
<b>Julius Juukulius.</b>

14:34.967 --> 14:37.137
<b>So long as you keep
throwing around that crap</b>

14:37.177 --> 14:38.467
<b>like it means something,</b>

14:38.507 --> 14:41.177
<b>you're not even worth
my time to play with.</b>

14:41.217 --> 14:43.727
<b>[footsteps]</b>

14:43.767 --> 14:45.227
<b>[yawns]</b>

14:45.267 --> 14:47.187
<b>[grunts]</b>

14:47.227 --> 14:48.227
<b>Yah!</b>

14:48.267 --> 14:49.187
<b>[growls]</b>

14:49.227 --> 14:50.227
<b>[clanging]</b>

14:50.267 --> 14:51.187
<b>[growls]</b>

14:51.227 --> 14:52.527
<b>You're so boring.</b>

14:52.567 --> 14:55.067
<b>Playing exactly
by the book, are ya?</b>

14:55.107 --> 14:56.197
<b>Ah!</b>

14:56.237 --> 14:57.157
<b>[heavy impacts]</b>

14:57.197 --> 14:58.367
<b>Ugh!</b>

14:58.407 --> 14:59.657
<b>Ugh!</b>

14:59.697 --> 15:00.697
<b>Yah!</b>

15:00.737 --> 15:01.947
<b>[thuds]</b>

15:01.987 --> 15:03.707
<b>You get it?</b>

15:03.747 --> 15:05.537
<b>[grunts]</b>

15:05.577 --> 15:07.077
<b>Ha!</b>

15:08.957 --> 15:10.287
<b>[groans]</b>

15:10.337 --> 15:12.047
<b>[pants]</b>

15:12.087 --> 15:13.297
<b>Geh.</b>

15:13.337 --> 15:15.377
<b>Damn, you really are pathetic.</b>

15:15.417 --> 15:17.967
<b>How long have you been
using a sword, anyway?</b>

15:18.007 --> 15:20.347
<b>Just so you know, it's only
been three months for me,</b>

15:20.387 --> 15:22.057
<b>so I hope it hasn't
been too long.</b>

15:22.097 --> 15:23.177
<b>[pants]</b>

15:23.217 --> 15:27.847
<b>[choral music]</b>

15:27.897 --> 15:34.687
<b>♪ ♪</b>

15:34.737 --> 15:38.317
<b>I will, [gasps], defeat
you right here and now.</b>

15:38.357 --> 15:39.817
<b>What a dumb thing to say.</b>

15:39.867 --> 15:41.697
<b>You really think
that's possible?</b>

15:41.737 --> 15:42.657
<b>Well, it ain't.</b>

15:42.697 --> 15:44.997
<b>Least, not for you.</b>

15:45.747 --> 15:47.037
<b>[grunts]</b>

15:47.077 --> 15:48.157
<b>[thud]</b>

15:48.207 --> 15:49.957
<b>You can't lay
a scratch on me!</b>

15:49.997 --> 15:51.747
<b>You haven't yet,
and you never will!</b>

15:51.787 --> 15:52.837
<b>You're simply not good enough.</b>

15:52.877 --> 15:53.917
<b>[gasps]</b>

15:53.957 --> 15:55.207
<b>Get it through
your thick skull</b>

15:55.257 --> 15:57.217
<b>that you're never
gonna belong here!</b>

15:57.257 --> 15:59.257
<b>You're the wrong
actor for this scene.</b>

15:59.297 --> 16:01.097
<b>Nobody asked for you.</b>

16:01.137 --> 16:06.387
<b>♪ ♪</b>

16:06.427 --> 16:09.937
<b>Nobody's keeping an eye
out for a loser like you.</b>

16:09.977 --> 16:12.017
<b>They don't expect
anything of you.</b>

16:12.057 --> 16:14.317
<b>Don't be naive thinking
I'm just playing around,</b>

16:14.357 --> 16:15.897
<b>letting you off easy.</b>

16:15.937 --> 16:16.897
<b>[thud]</b>

16:16.937 --> 16:18.187
<b>Agh!</b>

16:19.737 --> 16:21.487
<b>[grunts]</b>

16:21.527 --> 16:22.527
<b>Damn.</b>

16:22.577 --> 16:24.157
<b>You withstood that attack?</b>

16:24.197 --> 16:27.327
<b>You're just getting more and
more boring as time goes on.</b>

16:29.497 --> 16:30.827
<b>[pants]</b>

16:30.877 --> 16:37.127
<b>♪ ♪</b>

16:39.087 --> 16:42.217
<b>Right now, this is all of me.</b>

16:43.967 --> 16:49.637
<b>This strength I have
is the only thing.</b>

16:50.387 --> 16:52.227
<b>Yah!</b>

16:52.267 --> 16:54.817
<b>There's hesitation
in your swordsmanship.</b>

16:54.857 --> 16:55.937
<b>Sorry, kid.</b>

16:55.977 --> 16:57.147
<b>[clang]</b>

16:57.187 --> 17:00.277
<b>You're not worthy
of the Heavenly Sword.</b>

17:00.317 --> 17:02.367
<b>In fact, you don't
even have what it takes</b>

17:02.407 --> 17:04.777
<b>to become a simple follower.</b>

17:04.827 --> 17:06.157
<b>[thunk]</b>

17:06.197 --> 17:07.787
<b>[gasps]</b>

17:08.157 --> 17:09.907
<b>[clacking]</b>

17:11.747 --> 17:16.627
<b>[ominous music]</b>

17:16.667 --> 17:19.457
<b>[SUBARU] I've seen with my own
two eyes how strong you are.</b>

17:19.507 --> 17:21.467
<b>My shame always reminds me.</b>

17:21.507 --> 17:24.177
<b>It doesn't matter
if no one else knows.</b>

17:25.347 --> 17:26.967
<b>Julius!</b>

17:29.017 --> 17:36.357
<b>♪ ♪</b>

17:38.067 --> 17:39.857
<b>[whoosh]</b>

17:49.407 --> 17:53.367
<b>[panting]</b>

17:53.417 --> 17:56.837
<b>[footsteps]</b>

17:56.877 --> 17:59.627
<b>[panting]</b>

18:03.797 --> 18:06.797
<b>It's very unsteady.</b>

18:06.847 --> 18:08.677
<b>Finally awake, huh?</b>

18:08.717 --> 18:11.387
<b>Are you carrying me
on your back?</b>

18:11.427 --> 18:12.427
<b>That's right.</b>

18:12.477 --> 18:13.807
<b>Just so you know,</b>

18:13.847 --> 18:15.937
<b>I've done this twice
now in recent history.</b>

18:15.977 --> 18:17.687
<b>Do you have any
idea how it feels</b>

18:17.727 --> 18:20.277
<b>to be doing this again
30 minutes after saying</b>

18:20.317 --> 18:22.487
<b>I never want to do this again?</b>

18:22.527 --> 18:25.657
<b>No wonder I awoke
feeling so uncomfortable.</b>

18:25.697 --> 18:28.577
<b>How about I just go
and drop you right here?</b>

18:28.617 --> 18:33.287
<b>[footsteps]</b>

18:39.417 --> 18:42.757
<b>Will Miss Anastasia
be all right?</b>

18:42.797 --> 18:44.547
<b>Her life's not in any danger.</b>

18:44.587 --> 18:46.427
<b>Actually, you came
a whole lot closer to death</b>

18:46.467 --> 18:49.427
<b>than she did,
up against him.</b>

18:49.467 --> 18:51.217
<b>You're gonna be real
surprised when you find</b>

18:51.267 --> 18:52.767
<b>out who that eyepatch guy was.</b>

18:52.807 --> 18:54.427
<b>[JULIUS]
Reid Astrea.</b>

18:54.477 --> 18:56.437
<b>Well, good job
figuring it out.</b>

18:56.477 --> 18:58.057
<b>I had to learn it from Shaula.</b>

18:58.107 --> 18:59.857
<b>I had a hunch about
it when he referred</b>

18:59.897 --> 19:01.687
<b>to himself as a stick swinger,</b>

19:01.727 --> 19:03.607
<b>but it wasn't
enough to confirm.</b>

19:03.647 --> 19:05.897
<b>I'm sorry I couldn't tell you.</b>

19:05.947 --> 19:07.447
<b>It's fine.</b>

19:07.487 --> 19:11.117
<b>[footsteps]</b>

19:12.287 --> 19:13.907
<b>Hey, Julius?</b>

19:13.947 --> 19:15.827
<b>I figure it's best
I tell you now,</b>

19:15.867 --> 19:18.327
<b>since you'll find out
when we're back, anyway.</b>

19:18.377 --> 19:21.127
<b>After both you and Miss
Anastasia were defeated,</b>

19:21.167 --> 19:22.957
<b>Emilia passed the exam.</b>

19:23.007 --> 19:24.507
<b>[grunts]</b>

19:24.547 --> 19:25.877
<b>But don't get me wrong.</b>

19:25.917 --> 19:27.587
<b>It's not as if she
matched that Reid guy</b>

19:27.637 --> 19:29.047
<b>in strength or anything.</b>

19:29.097 --> 19:31.807
<b>A lot of the fight worked
in her favor by chance.</b>

19:31.847 --> 19:35.177
<b>Plus, Emilia is-- well,
she's, you know, special.</b>

19:35.217 --> 19:40.477
<b>I guess what I'm saying is,
don't get too, uh, worked up.</b>

19:40.517 --> 19:41.767
<b>Worked up?</b>

19:41.817 --> 19:44.067
<b>If Miss Emilia was
able to pass the exam,</b>

19:44.107 --> 19:45.817
<b>then Reid
the Master Swordsman</b>

19:45.857 --> 19:47.697
<b>is not an
insurmountable obstacle.</b>

19:47.737 --> 19:50.697
<b>And that knowledge alone
helps us immensely.</b>

19:50.737 --> 19:51.697
<b>Oh, yeah.</b>

19:51.737 --> 19:53.117
<b>You're right.</b>

19:53.157 --> 19:55.077
<b>That's a good point.</b>

19:55.117 --> 19:57.037
<b>As long as you understand it.</b>

19:59.167 --> 20:01.997
<b>With that said, would
you mind letting me down?</b>

20:02.047 --> 20:04.797
<b>I fear if I spend much
more time on your back,</b>

20:04.837 --> 20:06.007
<b>I'll be unwell.</b>

20:06.047 --> 20:07.507
<b>Emilia would kill me
if she found out</b>

20:07.547 --> 20:09.837
<b>I made you go down
these stairs while you're hurt.</b>

20:09.887 --> 20:10.967
<b>I'm awake.</b>

20:11.007 --> 20:12.387
<b>I can walk down stairs myself.</b>

20:12.427 --> 20:14.557
<b>A little late
for the tough guy act.</b>

20:14.597 --> 20:17.347
<b>Everybody already saw
me carrying you earlier,</b>

20:17.387 --> 20:19.517
<b>except Shaula and
Miss Anastasia, that is,</b>

20:19.557 --> 20:21.397
<b>since they were both
still unconscious.</b>

20:21.437 --> 20:23.107
<b>That's my reason, then.</b>

20:23.147 --> 20:25.147
<b>I can't let
Miss Anastasia see me.</b>

20:25.187 --> 20:27.147
<b>Seriously, it's not
a big deal, Julius.</b>

20:27.187 --> 20:28.737
<b>[JULIUS]
Put me down.</b>

20:28.777 --> 20:30.697
<b>You know, you really
don't have to worry about--</b>

20:30.737 --> 20:31.987
<b>- Whoa!
- I told you to put me down!</b>

20:32.027 --> 20:33.617
<b>- What are you-- stop!
- Do you hear me?</b>

20:33.657 --> 20:34.617
<b>Hang on!</b>

20:34.657 --> 20:37.197
<b>[grunts]</b>

20:39.707 --> 20:40.997
<b>Are you kidding?</b>

20:41.037 --> 20:42.127
<b>You idiot!</b>

20:42.167 --> 20:43.247
<b>What the hell
were you thinking?</b>

20:43.287 --> 20:44.547
<b>[JULIUS]
Stay back!</b>

20:47.627 --> 20:49.717
<b>I can stand on my own.</b>

20:51.177 --> 20:54.507
<b>I never asked for your help,
nor do I need it.</b>

20:55.767 --> 20:57.097
<b>Stop.</b>

20:59.517 --> 21:02.857
<b>[gentle music]</b>

21:02.897 --> 21:05.317
<b>♪ ♪</b>

21:05.357 --> 21:06.477
<b>[grunts]</b>

21:07.607 --> 21:12.067
<b>Like I told you before,
I can stand up myself.</b>

21:12.117 --> 21:13.947
<b>It is a simple matter.</b>

21:15.027 --> 21:17.577
<b>Yes, I may take
more time than usual.</b>

21:17.617 --> 21:21.077
<b>But there's no need to put
you through any extra trouble.</b>

21:21.117 --> 21:23.457
<b>Would you mind going
on ahead and informing</b>

21:23.497 --> 21:25.337
<b>the others of what happened?</b>

21:25.377 --> 21:28.127
<b>I will explain
the majority myself,</b>

21:28.167 --> 21:29.337
<b>so don't worry.</b>

21:29.377 --> 21:31.217
<b>You need only tell
them that you found me</b>

21:31.257 --> 21:33.297
<b>and that I'll
join them shortly.</b>

21:36.387 --> 21:38.097
<b>Ah, damn it!</b>

21:38.137 --> 21:39.807
<b>Damn it, damn it, damn it.</b>

21:39.847 --> 21:41.017
<b>Idiots!</b>

21:41.057 --> 21:43.767
<b>You and I are both huge idiots!</b>

21:43.807 --> 21:44.767
<b>What do you think you're--</b>

21:44.807 --> 21:45.897
<b>Now shut your mouth.</b>

21:45.937 --> 21:47.437
<b>Stand up on your own, my ass.</b>

21:47.477 --> 21:48.937
<b>You're obviously
having a hard time</b>

21:48.977 --> 21:50.687
<b>even staying upright.</b>

21:50.737 --> 21:54.067
<b>You knew before that fight was
over that you couldn't win.</b>

21:54.117 --> 21:56.407
<b>Beaten, embarrassed,
knocked on your butt--</b>

21:56.447 --> 21:57.827
<b>and you had no choice</b>

21:57.867 --> 21:59.537
<b>but to keep going back
for more, right?</b>

21:59.577 --> 22:02.997
<b>There was just no other way to
get it all out of your system!</b>

22:03.037 --> 22:04.667
<b>Thanks to a certain someone,</b>

22:04.707 --> 22:07.917
<b>I understand pretty
damn well how that feels.</b>

22:07.957 --> 22:11.047
<b>[pants]</b>

22:13.007 --> 22:14.587
<b>I won't try
to pretend like I know</b>

22:14.637 --> 22:16.467
<b>what's really
going on deep inside</b>

22:16.507 --> 22:18.257
<b>that dense head of yours.</b>

22:18.307 --> 22:22.267
<b>But for right now, there is
absolutely no reason for you</b>

22:22.307 --> 22:24.727
<b>to shuffle your
sorry self all the way</b>

22:24.767 --> 22:27.857
<b>down this long-ass stairway
without anyone's help.</b>

22:27.897 --> 22:29.607
<b>I can spare you a shoulder,</b>

22:29.647 --> 22:32.567
<b>and I won't even
think of it as a favor.</b>

22:32.607 --> 22:34.567
<b>Looking back,
I realize I--</b>

22:35.987 --> 22:41.407
<b>so I'm not gonna let you go
down these stairs on your own.</b>

22:41.447 --> 22:45.287
<b>[footsteps]</b>

22:45.327 --> 22:49.747
<b>♪ ♪</b>

22:49.797 --> 22:51.127
<b>[JULIUS]
Subaru?</b>

22:51.167 --> 22:52.417
<b>[SUBARU]
Yeah?</b>

22:53.547 --> 22:55.007
<b>[JULIUS]
I'm sorry.</b>

22:55.047 --> 22:56.047
<b>[SUBARU]
Huh.</b>

22:56.087 --> 22:57.297
<b>Shut up.</b>

22:58.427 --> 23:04.227
<b>♪ ♪</b>

23:04.267 --> 23:07.477
<b>[JULIUS]
I am certain</b>

23:07.517 --> 23:10.857
<b>there's not a soul
who would believe it.</b>

23:10.897 --> 23:12.527
<b>That blowhard,</b>

23:12.567 --> 23:14.647
<b>the very same one
who made enemies of everyone</b>

23:14.687 --> 23:17.567
<b>in the castle's
Great Hall that day,</b>

23:17.607 --> 23:20.527
<b>as he finished
speaking those words,</b>

23:20.577 --> 23:23.407
<b>he couldn't deny his
frivolous attitude or the fact</b>

23:23.447 --> 23:26.457
<b>that he was riding purely
on momentum when he spoke them.</b>

23:27.497 --> 23:29.207
<b>And still--</b>

23:31.497 --> 23:33.257
<b>regardless,</b>

23:33.297 --> 23:35.297
<b>there was someone,</b>

23:35.337 --> 23:38.677
<b>one person in that hall
who was deeply moved by them.</b>

23:38.717 --> 23:40.007
<b>JULIUS JUUKULIUS</b>
